lemma wellformed_Received:
  all-traces
  "∀ sk msg1 i1 msg2 i2 #u #v.
    ((Received( sk, msg1, i1 ) @ #u) ∧ (Received( sk, msg2, i2 ) @ #v)) ⇒
    (((msg1 = msg2) ∧ (i1 = i2)) ∨ ((¬(msg1 = msg2)) ∧ (¬(i1 = i2))))"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ sk msg1 i1 msg2 i2 #u #v.
  (Received( sk, msg1, i1 ) @ #u) ∧ (Received( sk, msg2, i2 ) @ #v)
 ∧
  (((¬(msg1 = msg2)) ∨ (¬(i1 = i2)))) ∧ (((msg1 = msg2) ∨ (i1 = i2)))"
*/
by sorry















